# Headless fixture for late introduction (ABI-002, CuBit.Late_Introduction;
# tests/headless late-introduction): started before logstore, its optional
# logstore request is Absent at launch; procmgr introduces logstore when it
# starts, and the program's queued debug text then reaches logstore.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.late-intro-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [(service "logstore" "logstore")]
  optional => ["logstore"])
